      "content": "i know, i know... everyone says to call someone. but it's just more noise. people want me to \"get better\" so they don't have to feel awkward around me. but if the core of who i was is gone, what is there to save? it feels like i'm just performing being alive to satisfy everyone else. it's exhausting to keep up the act of being a person when there's nothing left inside.",
